{"id":"603102","name":"麻辣米线","author":"小洞天","authorId":"126119","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/603102/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米线","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"娃娃菜","amount":"1/3颗"},{"name":"豆腐皮","amount":"少许"},{"name":"空心菜","amount":"2颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"净锅加水烧开下入米线。","img":"images/603102/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入娃娃菜、豆腐皮同煮。","img":"images/603102/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入空心菜。","img":"images/603102/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入牛肉酱。","img":"images/603102/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入辣椒油。","img":"images/603102/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入花椒油。","img":"images/603102/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮至入味即可。最后淋少许陈醋。","img":"images/603102/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。麻辣鲜香。","img":"images/603102/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"简单快捷，厨房小白也可上手。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}